Bundled third-party files
-------------------------
narrate/models/mp.rnnn, narrate/models/sh.rnnn
  RNNoise model weights from https://github.com/GregorR/rnnoise-models, trained
  for Xiph's RNNoise (BSD-3-Clause). See narrate/models/README.md.

Software and models used but not included
-----------------------------------------
Voiceover runs, or downloads on first use, the following. Each has its own
licence and terms of use, which apply to your use of it:

  VoxCPM / VoxCPM2 (OpenBMB)      https://github.com/OpenBMB/VoxCPM
  Whisper (OpenAI)                https://github.com/openai/whisper
  FFmpeg                          https://ffmpeg.org/legal.html
  Ollama, and the models you run with it (the default, Gemma, is under the
  Gemma Terms of Use)             https://ollama.com
  PyTorch                         https://pytorch.org
